      "id": "bug-009",
      "timestamp": "2026-06-07T00:00:00.000Z",
      "error_message": "CSS and JS not loading with php artisan serve on Windows",
      "file": "server.php",
      "root_cause": "Two Windows-specific bugs: (1) realpath() normalises path separators to backslashes while $fullPath uses mixed slashes, so realpath() !== $fullPath is always true — every file is treated as a symlink. (2) mime_content_type() returns 'text/plain' for CSS/JS files on Windows, so browsers receive CSS with wrong Content-Type and refuse to apply it.",
      "fix": "Replaced the realpath symlink-detection approach with an explicit MIME type map. Known asset extensions (css, js, webp, woff2, etc.) are served via readfile() with correct Content-Type headers, bypassing both the unreliable realpath comparison and mime_content_type().",
      "tags": [
        "windows",
        "mime-type",
        "realpath",
        "server.php",
        "php-builtin-server",
        "css",
        "js"
      ],
      "related_bugs": [
